PXL
----

Minimal 2D graphics library in C99.

Features:
  - 2D primitives: line, rect, circle, triangle (outline + filled)
  - Canvas with scissor clipping, color, clear, blit
  - ARGB8888 pixel buffer (pixbuf)
  - Backends: SDL2, X11
  - Keyboard/mouse input

Build:
  make          # lib
  make lint     # run lint
  make test     # run tests
  make examples # demos
  make clean    # cleaning

  Backend selection via BACKEND=sdl or BACKEND=x11 (default)
  Changing Backends requires manual make clean.
  Test and demo will work only if main lib use the same BACKEND. Use make clean as needed.

Quick start:
    pxl_backend_init("Title", 800, 600, false);

    pxl_input_t input;
    pxl_input_init(&input);

    while (!pxl_input_is_pressed(&input, PXL_KEYB_ESCAPE) &&
           !pxl_input_is_pressed(&input, PXL_WM_QUIT)) {
        pxl_input_next_state(&input);
        pxl_backend_poll_events(&input.cur);

        pxl_buf_t pb;
        if (pxl_backend_begin_frame(&pb) == PXL_SUCCESS) {
            pxl_canvas_t cnv;
            pxl_canvas_init(&cnv, &pb);
            /* drawing: pxl_draw_*(), pxl_fill_*(), pxl_canvas_clear() */
            pxl_backend_end_frame();
        }
    }
    pxl_backend_deinit();

Examples:
  - demo_sketch.c - Etch-a-Sketch
  - demo_pong.c   - Pong game
  - demo_loops.c  - Game loop comparison: 3 squares on same line showing
                    Variable vs Fixed Accum vs Fixed Lerp timesteps
  - demo_gas.c    - Boltzmann gas simulation

Architecture:
  Core:
    buf.h          - unint32_t pixel buffer with stride alignment
    geom.h         - Geometry primitives (rect, span, point) and clipping
    canvas.h       - Drawing surface with color, scissor, clear, blit
    draw.h/c       - Basic 2D primitives (line, rect, span)
    draw_extra.h/c - Advanced 2D primitives (circle, triangle)
    err.h          - Error handling

  Backend:
    input.h       - Input state handling (keyboard, mouse, window events)
    backend.h     - Backend interface. Shall enforce ARGB8888 format.
                    Only one window is supported at the moment.
    backend_sdl.c - SDL2 backend (do not activate VSYNC)
    backend_x11.c - X11 backend

  Loop:
    stepper.h     - Time-stepped physics loop helper (fixed timestep, interpolation)

